    "lore": "Before the Bloodfall, Vorak ruled the eastern marches of Velmoragh from a throne carved out of a single ruby the size of a cathedral door. When the Blood Moon cracked and the Ancients were chained, his court was burned and his name was chiselled out of every monument. It was not enough. Nine centuries later the crimson rain woke him in the ossuary where his knights had hidden him, and he walked out still wearing the crown they buried him in. He fights for whoever promises him Velmoragh's throne, and he intends to collect.",
